{
  "about": "veffurator: a saturator after Ableton's Saturator, in the unit's own lists of effects (sounds and master) and on fx train's wagons. Knobs: drive (-36..+36 dB), type (analog, sine, medium, hard, fold, digital), output (-36..0 dB), mix; with shift held: color (a peak before the shaper, -100..+100, on/off), freq (100 Hz..10 kHz), clip (soft clip on the output) and dc (the DC filter). 2x oversampled. Stands on punch; changes no place of the firmware; needs the base.",
